# ===========================================================================
# equipconv.def
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Reorganized for readability. SEMANTICS UNCHANGED - every mapping that was
# live before is live now, with the same value. Only order and comments moved.
#
# Fields: <bodyType> <equipmentID> <convertToID> <gumpID> <hue>
#   gumpID  0 = equipmentID + 50000
#   gumpID -1 = convertToID  + 50000
#   else       literal gump id (female art = male + 10000)
#
# Used to show different equipment art per body type, e.g. so
# human clothing does not look wrong on the slimmer elf bodies.
#
# HOW TO ADD: find the "ADD NEW HERE" block for the right band and append.
#             Keep entries sorted so the next person can find them.
# ===========================================================================


